      "content": "To ground your protagonist, focus on the concept of \"guajeo,\" a pragmatic intelligence where members of marginalized communities solve problems through lateral thinking and localized negotiation rather than waiting for formal approval. His success in the hierarchy would rely heavily on deeply ingrained family loyalties and the \"familia sustenta la familia\" concept, where protecting clan members takes precedence over blackmail or official orders, often requiring him to play multiple bureaucratic roles to cover his tracks. You might introduce specific coded behaviors, such as knowing which slang terms signal danger versus business, or his quiet, restrained demeanor during negotiations which masks the volatility caused by unsatisfied family obligations. These details allow the actor to convey a character whose power comes from navigating complex social webs rather than solely from brute force.",
